@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
scale max 2000 width
title 01. Abnormal Transaction Adjustment (Admin)

|Admin|
start
:Initiate Transaction Review;
note right
  Triggered by requests from
  Finance, Counter, or Students.
end note

:Verify Evidence & Compliance;
note right
  Cross-checks transaction logs
  against supporting documents.
end note

if (Sufficient Evidence Provided?) then (No)
  :Reject Adjustment Request;
  note right: State missing requirements
  stop
endif

if (Transaction State Modifiable?) then (No)
  :Escalate to Investigation/Refund Flow;
  note right
    Used when a transaction is locked
    or requires a full reversal.
  end note
  stop
endif

:Define Adjustment Strategy;
note right
  **Options include:**
  * Manual Balance Correction
  * Refund Initiation
  * Audit Note Attachment
end note

|Internal Wallet System|
:Apply Financial Adjustment;

:Archive Evidence & Audit Log;
note right
  Stores the reason, approver ID,
  and attached documents.
end note

|Admin|
:Communicate Outcome to Requester;
stop
@enduml